WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Bore sets the cylinder width. Stroke sets piston travel.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.200
One cylinder sweeps a volume as its piston moves.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.400
Add all four cylinders to get total displacement.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.000
Displacement alone does not determine power. Source: OpenStax, Volume and geometry.
